# Pacing: all three theatres flown the same scripted way, in GODMODE (so a
# run lasts), for tools/pace.py: per factory, a jump to it (Ctrl+L, 9), 12 s
# weaving and shooting round it, a jump back, its bombs, then 6 s flying off.
# About 2.3 minutes a theatre. Not part of agk test (it's long):
#   agk run -f tools/pacing.agk -o build/pacing && python3 tools/pace.py build/pacing/serial.txt
wait-serial "AGK t0"
wait 10
press fire 2
wait-serial "theatre loaded=0"
wait 10
key 0x63
key 0x28
wait 5
key 0x0A
wait 30
# theatre 1
key 0x63
key 0x28
wait 5
key 0x09
wait 20
press up+fire 30
press up 30
press left+up 14
press up+fire 30
press up 6
press right+up 28
wait 6
